{"name": "Dirtzone", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/a79a1255ae1944da311a9f06524bdc1d.poster.avif?t=1786626247\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/a79a1255ae1944da311a9f06524bdc1d.webm?t=1786626247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/a79a1255ae1944da311a9f06524bdc1d.mp4?t=1786626247\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>No Roads\u00a0 No Limits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/>Drive through challenging terrain, from muddy trails to rocky hills. Customize your vehicle, unlock new upgrades, and master each environment with precision and skill. Whether you're a casual explorer or a hardcore offroad enthusiast, this game delivers an immersive and adrenaline-pumping journey into the wild.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Crash Into Other Cars:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forget the brakes and dive into traffic! Use all your power to take down your opponents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/7eae644934006b111e0408aac45fe948.poster.avif?t=1786626247\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/7eae644934006b111e0408aac45fe948.webm?t=1786626247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/7eae644934006b111e0408aac45fe948.mp4?t=1786626247\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Weather Challenges:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rain, snow, or fog\u2026 Stay in control in every condition!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"720\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/40a8d5beaf73ea7d8c338be4ad5b82c3.avif?t=1786626247\" width=\"1280\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dangerous Ramps:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump from high ramps and perform maneuvers in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/648e387b4633e453d6977882848a18ed.poster.avif?t=1786626247\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/648e387b4633e453d6977882848a18ed.webm?t=1786626247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/648e387b4633e453d6977882848a18ed.mp4?t=1786626247\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Chase Your Rivals:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your racing line, overtake, and seize the advantage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/6a8c05fde2455edc28f23c9187f5d9f8.poster.avif?t=1786626247\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/6a8c05fde2455edc28f23c9187f5d9f8.webm?t=1786626247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/extras/6a8c05fde2455edc28f23c9187f5d9f8.mp4?t=1786626247\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to DirtZone</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Experience the ultimate offroad adventure Drive powerful 4x4 trucks across rugged terrain, deep mud, and harsh weather. Upgrade your vehicles, master challenging trails, and explore untamed lands.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911950/da7b6a01e95fdb095ea82ccecd22f9a85f67e2c7/header.jpg?t=1786626247", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Action-Adventure", "Adventure", "Driving", "Atmospheric", "Physics"], "developers": "Oguz Abdullah Celik, ALIyerEdon", "publishers": "Oguz Abdullah Celik, ALIyerEdon", "release_date": "Sep 14, 2025", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "3911950", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "20 August 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/4Wmn3NsCC4s", "first_seen": 1755640800.0, "review_rank": 1514}